---
description: Apply the Angular architecture rules of apps/web
globs:
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.html"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `apps/web/AGENTS.md`. Before changing application code, read `apps/web/docs/architecture-boundaries.md` and apply the architecture rules.

If the change touches state management, also read `apps/web/docs/architecture-state-management.md`.

File-name suffixes carry architectural meaning (see `apps/web/docs/architecture-boundaries.md`, "File-Name Suffixes"). Renaming or moving a file across suffixes is a re-classification, not a cosmetic change — verify it against those rules first.

Do not bypass documented domain boundaries. Prefer small, focused changes.
